1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:01,916
Your Majesty is right.

2
00:00:01,916 --> 00:00:05,250
None of us would
dare question the Godfather's identity.

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,458
Now do you still doubt me?

4
00:00:09,958 --> 00:00:11,875
You really are the Godfather?

5
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:16,750
If you're so extraordinary, why were
you cast out by your family?

6
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,708
Why did you go
dig in the mines?

7
00:00:18,708 --> 00:00:21,583
I saw through the vanity
of the world long ago.

8
00:00:22,125 --> 00:00:24,000
I knew that only
by living among the ordinary

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
could I truly understand
real life and genuine hearts.

10
00:00:27,833 --> 00:00:30,625
So I hid my identity
and became a simple miner,

11
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:33,541
just to experience what it means to be human.

12
00:00:33,541 --> 00:00:39,291
Even so… if you loved
me, why didn't you tell me?

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,500
Back then I was only
the eldest son of Carter.

14
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,791
That alone made you feel inferior.

15
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:46,583
If I had told
you I was the Godfather,

16
00:00:46,583 --> 00:00:48,791
your insecurity would
have been even worse.

17
00:00:49,416 --> 00:00:52,333
I planned to support you
in secret until you grew strong,

18
00:00:52,333 --> 00:00:53,541
then reveal everything.

19
00:00:55,791 --> 00:00:58,125
But the moment you
gained a little power,

20
00:00:58,583 --> 00:01:00,750
you threw me away like garbage.

21
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:02,083
It's not my fault!

22
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:05,916
For five whole years everyone
mocked me for marrying a miner!

23
00:01:05,916 --> 00:01:07,375
I had no choice!

24
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:11,125
I couldn't let the Scott
family be humiliated because of me!

25
00:01:11,125 --> 00:01:13,833
The one who humiliated the
Scott family was never me.

26
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,083
It was your own vanity.

27
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:23,291
Livia, this ring was meant for you.

28
00:01:24,041 --> 00:01:26,125
Your shallowness and
hypocrisy made you lose

29
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:27,875
everything that was within your reach.

30
00:01:27,875 --> 00:01:29,000
Now get out.

31
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,500
You no longer
deserve to stand here.

32
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:42,291
Severin, my daughter gave you
the best years of her life!

33
00:01:42,291 --> 00:01:44,291
You can't abandon her!

34
00:01:47,583 --> 00:01:49,708
How dare you reproach the Godfather!

35
00:01:51,541 --> 00:01:53,000
Enough, Cassia.

36
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Don't dirty your hands.

37
00:01:58,125 --> 00:02:00,958
I secretly supported the
Scott family for years,

38
00:02:00,958 --> 00:02:03,291
and you repaid me with ingratitude.

39
00:02:04,416 --> 00:02:07,041
Everything happening today
is your own doing.

40
00:02:07,041 --> 00:02:09,000
Don't make me punish anyone else.

41
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,041
Get out of Emeraldstone now.

42
00:02:11,541 --> 00:02:13,250
Godfather, please don't do this!

43
00:02:16,250 --> 00:02:19,000
I know you still love Livia.

44
00:02:20,791 --> 00:02:22,291
Stop.

45
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,041
You two would be happy together!

46
00:02:28,041 --> 00:02:29,500
Mother, stop.

47
00:02:33,625 --> 00:02:37,166
Let the Scott family keep
what little dignity we have left.

48
00:02:37,166 --> 00:02:38,083
We're leaving.

49
00:02:42,416 --> 00:02:45,333
I'm sorry. I wasn't worthy of you.

50
00:02:45,375 --> 00:02:46,791
I wish you both happiness.
